Z||000032||cobra427||01-09-2000||02:06 AM||||Monkeyman,<BR>I don't mean to belabor the point of "assult weapons",but please have before you facts that will back up what you say.    Question- where can you find in the dictionary, (any),that mentions assult rifle? I have looked in three and was unable to find any referance to the term,assult rifle.<P>I was also unawhere of anyone talking about fully automatic weapons.I thought we talking about what the average law-abiding citizen was able buy at a gun store or gun show.There are very few people that I know(3) that have a class 2 licence,and I doubt very seriously whether any civilian would be able to attain one today.<P>My final statement being, as reguards to your statement about why "assult rifles" exist and their purpose. Reason #3..."for gang members". I know that you were only fooling right....  <BR>   This is not a flame, really.  &lt;~~~~~I'm just a stickler when it comes to facts and I saw errors in your post. Be of good cheer my fellow Fieroite.<BR>    cobra427||||reg||1
